# TapperVPN CLI and daemon dependencies

The following open source dependencies are used to build the [tappervpn][] and
[tappervpnd][] commands. These are primarily used on Linux and BSD variants as
well as an [option for macOS][].

[tappervpn]: https://pkg.go.dev/tappervpn.com/cmd/tappervpn
[tappervpnd]: https://pkg.go.dev/tappervpn.com/cmd/tappervpnd
[option for macOS]: https://tailscale.com/kb/1065/macos-variants/

